🇺🇦🇧🇾 Ukraine claims that Belarus is forming a new airborne regiment near the border with Ukraine.

Several units have already been established, officers have been recruited, and the draft has been completed. The new regiment will be stationed near Gomel, 40 km from the Belarusian-Ukrainian border.

@medmannews

⚡️🇮🇷🇸🇦 Saudi Minister of Foreign Affairs, Faisal bin Farhan, received a phone call from his Iranian counterpart, Abbas Araghchi.

They discussed diplomatic efforts to de-escalate tensions.

@medmannews

⚡️🇷🇺🇺🇦 Since the Ukrainian attack on the Iranian ship in the Caspian Sea, Russian air strikes on Odessa have doubled in frequency. The targets include shipping port facilities and logistics. 

Odessa has been a major target since the war commenced, but recently, the intensity and diversity of the strikes have escalated, with the Banderol Light Cruise missiles and Oniks Super Sonic missiles being employed at a increased rate. 

